File Index: 58 of 109
Audio ID: 7510857935641677113
Audio Duration: 4m 17.8s (257.80s)
Start Time (Malaysia): 2026-11-10 10:17:39 +08
Detected Language: zh (Prob: 0.98)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Segment #1   [00:00:00,380 --> 00:00:03,340] | Elapsed:  13.68s | Words: 14 | Text: 你信不信就算让马云现在来过你的生活
Segment #2   [00:00:03,340 --> 00:00:04,320] | Elapsed:  13.68s | Words: 6  | Text: 他照样翻不了身
Segment #3   [00:00:04,320 --> 00:00:06,140] | Elapsed:  13.68s | Words: 10 | Text: 因为现在对于普通人的压迫
Segment #4   [00:00:06,760 --> 00:00:08,560] | Elapsed:  13.68s | Words: 9  | Text: 已经到了令人发指的地步
Segment #5   [00:00:08,560 --> 00:00:11,040] | Elapsed:  13.68s | Words: 12 | Text: 我讲一个刷新你们认知的小故事
Segment #6   [00:00:11,560 --> 00:00:13,800] | Elapsed:  13.68s | Words: 11 | Text: 我昨天晚上跟朋友喝完酒回家
Segment #7   [00:00:14,160 --> 00:00:16,160] | Elapsed:  13.68s | Words: 8  | Text: 我就没开车打出的车
Segment #8   [00:00:16,160 --> 00:00:16,820] | Elapsed:  13.68s | Words: 5  | Text: 它是个电池
Segment #9   [00:00:17,380 --> 00:00:19,440] | Elapsed:  13.68s | Words: 8  | Text: 这个司机跟我年龄差不多大
Segment #10  [00:00:19,440 --> 00:00:21,540] | Elapsed:  13.68s | Words: 11 | Text: 我感觉这不到四个岁头年轻
Segment #11  [00:00:21,540 --> 00:00:22,980] | Elapsed:  13.68s | Words: 7  | Text: 然后我喝完酒之后
Segment #12  [00:00:22,980 --> 00:00:24,140] | Elapsed:  13.68s | Words: 6  | Text: 我的话就比较多
Segment #13  [00:00:24,140 --> 00:00:24,900] | Elapsed:  13.68s | Words: 5  | Text: 我就跟他聊天
Segment #14  [00:00:24,900 --> 00:00:26,240] | Elapsed:  13.68s | Words: 5  | Text: 因为我很少打车
Segment #15  [00:00:26,620 --> 00:00:28,240] | Elapsed:  13.68s | Words: 9  | Text: 然后我上车一问我才知道
Segment #16  [00:00:28,760 --> 00:00:29,800] | Elapsed:  30.39s | Words: 6  | Text: 他这个车的租金
Segment #17  [00:00:29,800 --> 00:00:31,460] | Elapsed:  30.39s | Words: 7  | Text: 就开始我都不相信了
Segment #18  [00:00:31,460 --> 00:00:33,800] | Elapsed:  30.39s | Words: 13 | Text: 一个月的这个租金竟然高达四千多
Segment #19  [00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:35,080] | Elapsed:  30.39s | Words: 4  | Text: 然后我就问他
Segment #20  [00:00:35,080 --> 00:00:38,360] | Elapsed:  30.40s | Words: 12 | Text: 我说你一个月花这么多钱去租车
Segment #21  [00:00:38,360 --> 00:00:40,240] | Elapsed:  30.40s | Words: 10 | Text: 你干什么不自己去买辆车呢
Segment #22  [00:00:40,240 --> 00:00:42,560] | Elapsed:  30.40s | Words: 12 | Text: 我说你这个租金都完全买辆车了
Segment #23  [00:00:42,980 --> 00:00:43,900] | Elapsed:  30.40s | Words: 4  | Text: 然后他跟我说
Segment #24  [00:00:44,280 --> 00:00:47,100] | Elapsed:  30.40s | Words: 10 | Text: 家用车不能办理营运资质
Segment #25  [00:00:47,100 --> 00:00:48,680] | Elapsed:  30.40s | Words: 3  | Text: 然后万一
Segment #26  [00:00:48,680 --> 00:00:50,780] | Elapsed:  30.40s | Words: 13 | Text: 比方说他要家用车开车被抓了
Segment #27  [00:00:50,780 --> 00:00:51,320] | Elapsed:  30.40s | Words: 4  | Text: 还要罚款
Segment #28  [00:00:51,320 --> 00:00:53,220] | Elapsed:  30.40s | Words: 13 | Text: 这罚款从几千块钱到两万不等
Segment #29  [00:00:53,760 --> 00:00:54,860] | Elapsed:  30.40s | Words: 5  | Text: 然后快乐家的时候
Segment #30  [00:00:54,860 --> 00:00:55,800] | Elapsed:  30.40s | Words: 4  | Text: 他还跟我说
Segment #31  [00:00:55,800 --> 00:00:57,820] | Elapsed:  30.40s | Words: 10 | Text: 不仅是运营公司是这样的
Segment #32  [00:00:57,820 --> 00:00:59,560] | Elapsed:  47.11s | Words: 8  | Text: 就连打车的这个平台
Segment #33  [00:00:59,560 --> 00:01:00,660] | Elapsed:  47.11s | Words: 4  | Text: 也是出税的
Segment #34  [00:01:00,660 --> 00:01:01,820] | Elapsed:  47.11s | Words: 6  | Text: 你们能懂什么意思吗
Segment #35  [00:01:01,820 --> 00:01:03,480] | Elapsed:  47.11s | Words: 8  | Text: 和这个租车的逻辑差不多
Segment #36  [00:01:03,480 --> 00:01:05,760] | Elapsed:  47.11s | Words: 11 | Text: 然后他就拿他的手机给我看了一下
Segment #37  [00:01:06,580 --> 00:01:08,700] | Elapsed:  47.11s | Words: 14 | Text: 我打了这一单到他手里能用多少钱
Segment #38  [00:01:09,180 --> 00:01:10,440] | Elapsed:  47.11s | Words: 6  | Text: 我才恍然大悟
Segment #39  [00:01:10,440 --> 00:01:12,660] | Elapsed:  47.11s | Words: 12 | Text: 我给的车费好像是二十七块钱
Segment #40  [00:01:12,660 --> 00:01:15,300] | Elapsed:  47.11s | Words: 12 | Text: 然后实际上到他手里才十几块
Segment #41  [00:01:15,300 --> 00:01:16,240] | Elapsed:  47.11s | Words: 5  | Text: 才好像是十九
Segment #42  [00:01:16,240 --> 00:01:18,200] | Elapsed:  47.11s | Words: 8  | Text: 你说就这样一个出城比例
Segment #43  [00:01:18,200 --> 00:01:20,300] | Elapsed:  47.11s | Words: 7  | Text: 你想让一个中年男人
Segment #44  [00:01:20,300 --> 00:01:21,600] | Elapsed:  47.11s | Words: 7  | Text: 去过一个体面的生活
Segment #45  [00:01:21,600 --> 00:01:22,520] | Elapsed:  47.11s | Words: 4  | Text: 这怎么可能呢
Segment #46  [00:01:22,520 --> 00:01:24,160] | Elapsed:  47.11s | Words: 8  | Text: 我之前就看过一个报道
Segment #47  [00:01:24,160 --> 00:01:25,820] | Elapsed:  47.11s | Words: 7  | Text: 说的就是一个外卖员
Segment #48  [00:01:25,820 --> 00:01:27,600] | Elapsed:  65.51s | Words: 13 | Text: 他一个月大约跑了一千一百多万
Segment #49  [00:01:27,600 --> 00:01:29,480] | Elapsed:  65.51s | Words: 8  | Text: 然后每天风有无阻的
Segment #50  [00:01:29,480 --> 00:01:31,200] | Elapsed:  65.51s | Words: 12 | Text: 平均每单他能挣个五六块钱
Segment #51  [00:01:31,540 --> 00:01:33,620] | Elapsed:  65.51s | Words: 13 | Text: 一个月发了七千两百块钱的工资
Segment #52  [00:01:33,620 --> 00:01:34,860] | Elapsed:  65.51s | Words: 6  | Text: 然后他从那算账
Segment #53  [00:01:34,860 --> 00:01:36,080] | Elapsed:  65.51s | Words: 5  | Text: 说我车坏了
Segment #54  [00:01:36,080 --> 00:01:37,100] | Elapsed:  65.51s | Words: 7  | Text: 修车我花了三百
Segment #55  [00:01:37,100 --> 00:01:39,320] | Elapsed:  65.51s | Words: 10 | Text: 外卖放在车里被偷了一次
Segment #56  [00:01:39,320 --> 00:01:40,020] | Elapsed:  65.51s | Words: 5  | Text: 赔了一百五
Segment #57  [00:01:40,020 --> 00:01:41,800] | Elapsed:  65.51s | Words: 9  | Text: 剩下是六千七百块钱
Segment #58  [00:01:41,800 --> 00:01:42,920] | Elapsed:  65.51s | Words: 5  | Text: 然后他每个月
Segment #59  [00:01:42,920 --> 00:01:44,260] | Elapsed:  65.51s | Words: 7  | Text: 他要忘他的老家里
Segment #60  [00:01:44,260 --> 00:01:46,080] | Elapsed:  65.51s | Words: 11 | Text: 寄三千五百块钱去还房贷
Segment #61  [00:01:46,480 --> 00:01:48,680] | Elapsed:  65.51s | Words: 11 | Text: 然后今年是他还贷款的第四年
Segment #62  [00:01:49,060 --> 00:01:50,740] | Elapsed:  65.51s | Words: 9  | Text: 然后他是上有老下有小的
Segment #63  [00:01:50,740 --> 00:01:53,220] | Elapsed:  65.51s | Words: 15 | Text: 每个月差不多要给家里寄一千块钱开支
Segment #64  [00:01:53,220 --> 00:01:54,060] | Elapsed:  65.51s | Words: 4  | Text: 去当生活费
Segment #65  [00:01:54,520 --> 00:01:56,260] | Elapsed:  84.07s | Words: 9  | Text: 然后他自己过得就特别惨
Segment #66  [00:01:56,260 --> 00:01:58,900] | Elapsed:  84.07s | Words: 11 | Text: 他租了一半的这种地下室
Segment #67  [00:01:58,900 --> 00:02:00,360] | Elapsed:  84.07s | Words: 8  | Text: 房租一个月六百块钱
Segment #68  [00:02:00,360 --> 00:02:02,600] | Elapsed:  84.07s | Words: 13 | Text: 你们能不能想象到六百块钱的房租
Segment #69  [00:02:02,600 --> 00:02:03,820] | Elapsed:  84.07s | Words: 9  | Text: 他这房子在破成什么样
Segment #70  [00:02:04,260 --> 00:02:05,800] | Elapsed:  84.07s | Words: 8  | Text: 然后他自己每天做饭吃
Segment #71  [00:02:05,800 --> 00:02:09,200] | Elapsed:  84.07s | Words: 11 | Text: 大概一天可能开销二十块钱左右
Segment #72  [00:02:09,200 --> 00:02:10,900] | Elapsed:  84.07s | Words: 10 | Text: 就从来没在外边吃过饭
Segment #73  [00:02:10,900 --> 00:02:12,400] | Elapsed:  84.07s | Words: 10 | Text: 一个月吃饭也得花六百块
Segment #74  [00:02:12,400 --> 00:02:13,580] | Elapsed:  84.07s | Words: 6  | Text: 中途要是饿了
Segment #75  [00:02:13,580 --> 00:02:14,820] | Elapsed:  84.07s | Words: 6  | Text: 他就买点馒头
Segment #76  [00:02:14,820 --> 00:02:16,120] | Elapsed:  84.07s | Words: 8  | Text: 吃个咸菜去垫一垫
Segment #77  [00:02:16,480 --> 00:02:18,360] | Elapsed:  84.07s | Words: 8  | Text: 一个月他这个垫池充电
Segment #78  [00:02:18,360 --> 00:02:20,840] | Elapsed:  84.07s | Words: 12 | Text: 他这个垫池好像还得花三百块钱
Segment #79  [00:02:20,840 --> 00:02:22,280] | Elapsed:  84.07s | Words: 9  | Text: 然后平时你算算自己抽烟
Segment #80  [00:02:22,280 --> 00:02:23,480] | Elapsed:  84.07s | Words: 6  | Text: 十块钱一包烟
